      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I contacted Australian Sustainable Energy to provide a proposal and quote for the install of a residential solar system for our new home. I was immediately impressed with the level of customer service and quick proposal and quote received, which contained a few options and recommendations for consideration based on analysis of our location, energy billing and budget etc. Importantly the proposals also included additional information about STC federal government rebates available, the best positioning of the system, recommended system to install and why (quality of technology etc panels and inverter), financial return on investment analysis and also how they would manage safety during the install process. As the system has been operating for some time now we have certainly enjoyed the benefits of installing this system at our home. This has resulted in significant energy bill savings for us, for example last quarter we received a rebate of +$8 from the energy utility and the quarter before that we only paid about $11. I would certainly use Australian Sustainable Energy again and I would recommend them to anyone (and I certainly do so already). I think everyone should have solar as the financial return on investment is a no-brainer and not to mention the emissions reductions that come from harnessing the energy of the natural sun! Thanks Jason Pyne and Grant for setting us up!",
